<title>FRANCE: France sells 17.87 bln Ffr BTANs at auction.</title>
<headline>France sells 17.87 bln Ffr BTANs at auction.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury sold the following</p>
<p>BTANs at auction on Thursday.</p>
<p> MATURITY	COUPON	SALE AMOUNT     AVERAGE YIELD</p>
<p> 12.OCT.98	4.50	  9.380 BLN	  4.22</p>
<p> BID AMT/COVER    NON-COMPETITIVE BIDS   LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE</p>
<p> 31.85 BLN/3.4		     NIL	    100.52</p>
<p> PCT ALLOTED AT LOWEST PRICE*		  PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p> 40.0						   14.OCT</p>
<p> * PRICES ABOVE GOT ALLOTMENTS IN FULL     NEXT AUCTION</p>
<p>							   17.OCT</p>
<p> MATURITY	COUPON	SALE AMOUNT     AVERAGE YIELD</p>
<p> 12.OCT.01	5.50	  8.485 BLN	  5.32</p>
<p> BID AMT/COVER    NON-COMPETITIVE BIDS   LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE</p>
<p> 23.043 BLN/2.7		   523 MLN	  100.77</p>
<p> PCT ALLOTED AT LOWEST PRICE*		  PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p> 60.0						    14.OCT</p>
<p> * PRICES ABOVE GOT ALLOTMENTS IN FULL     NEXT OFFER</p>
<p>							   17.OCT</p>
<p>NOTE - The Treasury originally announced it would sell 17 to 19 billion francs of BTANs in total today. The total bid cover ratio of the auction was 3.1.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
